:: Museum Hopeless Cycle Story Back
<<effects>>
You tell Winter you changed your mind, now that you remembered you already knew the story. Winter grumbles good-naturedly. "And I got my nice chair out for this, too..."
<br><br>

<<He>> stands up, turning around to grab the chair once more. "Well, let me know if you change your mind."
<br><br>

