			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			The Hand appears nervous for a moment, but it doesn't last. <span class="red"><<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hair settles back down.</span>
			You think about the stories of witches' hair being important to their power, and the spot ripped out from the back of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head.
			Had <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> been given something to offset that weakness, something might have happened.
		<<else>>
			<span class="blue"><<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hair begins to float, as if being lifted by an unfelt wind.</span>
			<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHair")>>
				<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHairBlooms")>>
					<span class="purple"><<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> braid elegantly flows, the witchblooms within softly glowing.</span>
				<<else>>
					<<set $hc.witchHair to "hair-clean">>
