		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red"><<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> dirty, blood-matted hair appears to briefly move on its own.</span>
		You think about the stories of witches' hair being important to their power.
		Had it been cleaned, something might have happened.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $prisoner.love gte 60>>
		Your mind races back to everything you've done for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> over this past week. Your fists clench. Is this really what's right?
		Is this what <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> deserves? Is this justice? Does Virgo smile upon you for this?
