		<br><br>

		<<link [[Intervene|Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You avert your eyes and stick true to your faith. You did your duty, and did not become attached.</span>
		<br><br>

		The hammer comes down, striking its final redemption.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Just watch|Hopeless Cycle Ending D]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
