<</if>>

:: Hopeless Cycle Blood Heart
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>
<span class="narration">In a desperate attempt to break free, the witch revealed <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> final gambit.</span>
<br><br>

Everything fades to white, except for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
<br><br>

In the emptiness, you see visions.<br>
Granting <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> clothing, and dressing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.<br>
Washing the blood from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hair and body.<br>
Sharing your names.<br>
Taking <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands, and watching <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> create flowers.<br>
<<if $temple_burden gte 50 and $prisonerEvents.includes("love")>>
	<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("virginity")>>
		The love you made.
	<<else>>
		Kissing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You feel something tug harshly at your chest, grasping for your heart, trying to pull it up through your throat.
	<br><br>

	<span class="green">But you've already given it to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, and a heart so burdened cannot be stolen.</span><<note "Virgo's Burden" "gold">>
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> stares at you, realising that <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> grasp for you failed. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> closes <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eyes with a tired, resigned smile, accepting <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> fate.
	<br><br>

	The hammer hangs above <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, poised to strike its final redemption. Everything is silent.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Save <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>|Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene]]>><<set $hc.loved to true>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Just watch|Hopeless Cycle Ending D]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<set $trauma to 5000>><<set $control to 0>>
	<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("virginity")>>
		The love you made.
		<br><br>

		You feel something tug harshly at your chest. Cruel black fingers reach into your mind.
		<br><br>

		<span class="red">The clothes. Your name leaving <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> lips. Your virginity.<br>
		<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("love")>>
			You granted <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> three gifts. In return, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> stole the heart you so graciously offered <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
		<<else>>
			You granted <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> three gifts, which allowed <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to steal your heart.
		<</if>>
		</span>
	<<else>>
		Kissing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
		<br><br>

		You feel something tug harshly at your chest. Cruel black fingers reach into your mind.
		<br><br>

		<span class="red">The clothes. Your name leaving <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> lips. Your kiss.<br>
		<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("love")>>
			You granted <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> three gifts. In return, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> stole the heart you so graciously offered <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
		<<else>>
			You granted <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> three gifts, which allowed <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to steal your heart.
		<</if>>
		</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	A devious smile crosses <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face. That isn't what you see, though. You see the face of your beloved Nona, begging for your aid.
	<br><br>

	Your <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters'>> can't hold you. You break from their grasp and grab your whip, lashing it directly at the Bishop's Hand.<<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>
	You strike the hammer from <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> grasp.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> mouth opens again, and <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> issues a command that travels through you, into all of your siblings.
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> only needed a way in. You were <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> open door to their hearts.
	<br><br>

	<span class="purple">The devils masquerading as your siblings all grab their ears, trying to shut <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> out as you run to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> side.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Free <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>|Hopeless Cycle Ending A]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>
