:: Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene
<<set _thermoDisable to true>>

<<if $hc.loved>>
	<<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>
	You're left alone with <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> in the white void.
	More memories play before you, in reversed order. Your fist clenches around the handle of your whip as you unclasp it from your belt.
	<br><br>

	Finally, they reach the first day. When the Bishop's Hand gave you your orders.
	<br><br>

	You are <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> gaoler. You are to protect the world from <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. You are to protect <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> from the world.
	A world that despises <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, full of people that wish <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mutilated, violated, burned, damned to an eternity of torture.
	<br><br>

	People like your siblings. The cloister.
	<br><br>

	You are <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> gaoler. You must protect <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> from them.
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> is a monster, one of the cloister's own making.
	For so long as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> remains trapped here, the cycle will continue.
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> will be punished for being punished.
	<br><br>

	<<if $hc.trueEndAvailable>>
		Hatred will breed hatred.<br>
		Paranoia will spur paranoia.<br>
		Stagnation will self-perpetuate.<br>
		Perdition is eternity.<br>
		Desperation spirals.<br>
		Love's bloom withers away.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	You must take <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> away from here. It's the only way to stay true to your faith. Everyone else has been led astray.
<<else>>
	You've made your decision. This is not justice. There's no redemption in this mutilation.
	<br><br>

	The altar's too far. You won't make it, but perhaps you don't need to.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Use your whip to strike the needle away|Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene 2]]>><<pass 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Use your whip to strike the Bishop's Hand|Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene 2]]>><<pass 1>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Use your whip to strike the silver manacle|Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene 2]]>><<pass 1>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
