:: Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>

<<if $phase is 3 and $hc.loved and $prof.whip gte 1000 and $hc.wraith>>
	You still have time. Rather than running forwards, you shake out of your <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters'>>' grasp and take a step backwards.
	They're unusually sluggish. Perhaps <<= $prisoner.name>>'s whisper affected them too. They're snapping out of it quickly, though.
	<br><br>

	You make two rapid attacks at their feet, easily tripping them both. Your eyes focus on the silver manacle binding <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> left arm.
	<br><br>

	It's a nearly impossible target. Nearly.<br>
	You take four rapid steps forward, beginning a strike on the second.<br>
	You shift your body weight perfectly, fully extending your arm and flicking your wrist. Time slows down.<br>
	The smallest of adjustments. The tip of your whip just barely makes contact with the silver manacle.<br>
	<span class="green">The explosive snap shatters it to pieces.</span><br>
	Your strike tolls midnight, and echoes throughout the forest. <<note "Ancient Arts" "wraith">>
	<br><br>

	<<= $prisoner.name>>'s eye snaps open.
	<<if $prisonerBrands.includesAny("left arm", "right arm")>>
		It was a perfect strike, <span class="red">but it was all for nothing.</span> The branding you placed on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> arm seals the Dark Elk's influence from it, leaving <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> helpless all the same.
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> gives you one last warm, weak smile as your <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters'>> restrain you again. It was a valiant effort.
		<br><br>

		The hammer finds its mark.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Ending D]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> blackened left arm pulls free, <span class="pink">immediately growing to nearly double its length as <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> fingers sharpen into points. The sound of snapping bone and sinew fill the air.</span>
		<br><br>

		Without stopping, it slashes at the Bishop's Hand. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> tries to shield <<worldMale 'himself' 'herself'>> with <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> arm. Three deep gashes open on it, sending the hammer flying.
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> claws at <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> collar as the Hand recovers. It scrapes and pulls uselessly against the silver, smoke rising from the contact, warded from the Elk's touch.
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> reaches further back, and grabs the chain binding it to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> instead. <span class="green">The chain isn't silver. It's loudly pulled apart, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head now free.</span>
		<br><br>

		The chain of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> right manacle quickly meets the same fate.
		Like the left, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> right arm further blackens and grows. The manacle, no longer held in place, is forced further and further up <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> arm as the limb thickens.
		<br><br>

		The Bishop's Hand backs away in fear as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> pushes <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> up. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> slashes at <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> again. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>>'s knocked aside, <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> tunic ripped to shreds.
		<br><br>

		<span class="green">You reach <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> side at last.</span>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Stand by <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>|Hopeless Cycle Ending S Attempt]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Mesmerised as they are by the climax of the ritual, you manage to shake free from the grip of your <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters'>>.
	They're briefly taken off-guard.
	<br><br>

	You run towards the altar. You won't make it. Your <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters'>> pursue. Everyone looks to you.
	<br><br>

	<<if $phase is 1>>
		You unclasp your whip and let it fly. <span class="green">You strike true, and the needle flies from the Hand's grasp, away from <<= $prisoner.name>>'s skin.</span>
		<br><br>

		The hammer still comes down, <span class="red">smashing into <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> right arm.</span> The Hand looks down in shock, before looking up to see you approach.
	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		You unclasp your whip and let it fly. <span class="green">You strike true, hitting the Hand right in the face. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> staggers backward and drops the hammer.</span>
	<<else>>
		You unclasp your whip and let it fly. It's an impossible target. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> hand is in the way, and the distance is all wrong.
		Your siblings, chasing you, wouldn't allow you such precision.
		<span class="red">Everything would need to be perfect. You would need more time.</span>
		<br><br>

		You miss. Your whip snaps the air right above <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. It's enough for a distraction, at least, as the Hand pauses to look up at you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<wearProp "rock">>
	You pick up a heavy rock as you continue to run, and bring its whole weight down on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacle. It shatters at the same instant you're tackled by the confessors.
	<<if $hc.loved>>
		<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye snaps open.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $prisonerBrands.includes("left arm")>>
		<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> left arm, now freed, grips for the collar. <span class="red">The cross branding you seared into <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> left arm glows with faint embers, sealing the Dark Elk's influence.</span>
		It scrapes uselessly against the silver collar. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> tries reaching back for the chain instead, to no avail.
		<br><br>

		The rest of your siblings approach as the Bishop's Hand stares in shock. <span class="red">You're dragged away, deprived of your whip and restrained.</span>
		The Bishop shakes <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> head in disappointment. "<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> has swayed you, my <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>. Do not fret. We will purify <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> influence from your soul."
		<br><br>

		<span class="red">The witch is easily restrained again, unable to fight back.</span> The ritual continues.
		<br><br>

		The hammer strikes <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> down. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> lets out one final gasp.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Ending D]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> left arm, now freed, immediately grows. <span class="pink">You hear the snapping of bone and sinew as the black limb nearly doubles in length, each finger ending in a sharp point.</span>
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> uses it to claw at <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> collar as the Bishop's Hand stares in shock. It scrapes and pulls uselessly against the silver, smoke rising from the contact, warded from the Elk's touch.
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> reaches further back, and strikes the chain binding it to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> instead. <span class="green">The chain isn't silver. It loudly shatters, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head now free.</span>
		<br><br>

		The chain of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> right manacle quickly meets the same fate.
		<<if $prisonerBrands.includes("right arm")>>
			<span class="red">The cross branding on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> right arm glows with faint embers, preventing it from undergoing the same transformation.</span>
		<<else>>
			Like the left, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> right arm further blackens and grows. The manacle, no longer held in place, is forced further and further up <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> arm as the limb thickens.
		<</if>>
		The Bishop's Hand now backs away in fear as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> pushes <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> up, while the rest of your siblings approach. <span class="red">You're dragged away, deprived of your whip and restrained.</span>
		The Bishop shakes <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> head in disappointment. "<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> has swayed you, my <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>. Do not fret. We will purify <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> influence from your soul."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene 3]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Hopeless Cycle Blood Intervene 3
<<set _thermoDisable to true>>

Your siblings halt as the writhing under <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> skin continues. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> moans in mixed pain and ecstasy. You hear something like glass cracking as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> convulses.
<span class="red">A second antler erupts from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head, imperfectly mirroring the first.</span> It doesn't dig into <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye socket like the first does.
