	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> collapses in a heap on the ground. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> elongated limbs slash at any who approach. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> fights back, <span class="red">but can't hope to escape when <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> can't even stand.</span>
