		Your <<worldMale 'brothers' 'sisters'>> all freeze. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> takes a clumsy step. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks down at <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> legs, and begins laughing softly.
		<br><br>

